WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,410
Where are the specific coordinates?

2
00:00:01,690 --> 00:00:03,330
The driver thought it was a mistake

3
00:00:03,330 --> 00:00:04,570
No precise coordinates recorded

4
00:00:04,570 --> 00:00:06,730
Ask him what he saw then

5
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:09,020
What did I see then?

6
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:10,380
What a great place to upgrade the signal belt

7
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:12,360
Some people say that there is no hidden yellow buoy.

8
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,360
Is it near the place where the signal band is being upgraded?

9
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:15,840
One building was severely damaged

10
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:19,340
Severely tilted yellow navigation buoy

11
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:21,500
How many such navigation buoys are there in this area?

12
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:24,440
57

13
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:26,670
Let me check even one of them

14
00:00:54,590 --> 00:00:56,670
Don't try to escape this time
